		{"id":"1174899da42a6e1c","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_SwXQbdksuu.mp4","x":3040,"y":818,"width":1604,"height":902},
		{
			"id":"e0c372c9b52b063e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Chip Locations\n1. Already inserted at the start of every run\n2. Inside vase in Entrance Hall (Use Hammer)\n3. Buried near the Wooden Bridge that leads to the Outer Room",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3040,
			"y":540,
			"width":640,
			"height":177
		},
		{
			"id":"ff3460d6340c04ff",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Known Logins**\n- Randolph Moore - MoorR - Admin\n- Thompson Kimberly - ThomK - Admin\n- Anne Babbage - BabbA - Normal User\n- Hartley Ruota - RuotH - Disabled \n- Denny Revane - RevaD - Disabled",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-708,
			"y":2381,
			"width":560,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"b8f9676a659b48ca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Hidden Logins**\n- Jean Ribbon - RibbJ - Admin\n- Paul Withe / Phillip White - WithP - Admin\n- Bo Lee - LeeB - Fake Admin to trick Bon Margle",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-708,
			"y":2641,
			"width":560,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"779d6bdbdb6c7f1d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Attempted Logins**\n- Kirk Darren - DarrK - Fail\n- Jean Ribbon - RibbJ? - Found in Fake Passport\n- Paul / Phillip With??? - WithP - Found in the Terminal Admin Logs after using RibbJ.\n\t- This is actually Phillip White, one of the publishers associated with Marion Marigold\n- Bon Margle - Fail\n- Black bridge Book \n\t- Geoffrey Heartslasher \n\t- Jesper\n\t- Miller\n\t- Ravia\n\t- Fodric Lee\n- Try **Caleb Manning**, since he is also associated with Marion Marigold.\n- SwansongHSS?\n- HSS?\n- HerbertSSinclair?\n- A New Clue Books\n\t- Bo Lee",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-128,
			"y":2381,
			"width":480,
			"height":680
		},
